     "t": "p",
     "html": "Dull skin can be described most accurately as lacking lustre - a flat complexion and uneven skin tone due to its inability to reflect light uniformly. Similar to other skin concerns, a number of internal and external factors can contribute to the skin’s radiance, including: lack of exfoliation, aging, dehydration, lack of nutrition and stress. To help target this skin concern, the following services and products might be right for you."
    }
